      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. i noticed the list is pretty short though... only 7 items. since the ranking script is looking for \"density,\" i'm worried this might get buried at the bottom of the sprint report. \n\ncan you try to refine this? i still need them to be actual tasks, but maybe you can be more thorough in how you break down the work? if a task has multiple parts or steps that are distinct, feel free to pull them out into their own bullets so the system sees a higher actionable item count. just keep it professional and don't make it look like fluff, if that makes sense.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
